display_name = "Survey Routine"
description = "The standard survey package, burned to a chip. Every pilot's first ability: point it at a rock to read the ore inside, or at a ship to log Scan Data. Costs nothing to run — curiosity should be free. A fitted survey scanner makes it reach further and finish faster."
